  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'southwestern-sterling-pendant-vintage-navajo-mother-of-pearl-silver-brooch', '4611938314', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4611938314/southwestern-sterling-pendant-vintage?click_key=EuF0FihyIEpKRoa5cd1jahRJH-99%3ALT958940e808c7ccd4325727681e4384776b29bc34&click_sum=9e6cd99d&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-676139-20-8&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Southwestern Sterling Pendant , Vintage Navajo Mother of Pearl Silver Brooch', 'Vintage circa 1970''s to 80''s Navajo made brooch/pendant, sterling silver oval shaped featuring a light pink mother of pearl cabochon surround by a stamped leaves, bead and sterling wire details. The back of the piece has a bail open on one side, a safety clasp with pin and is etched Charles Morris sterling. MEASUREMENTS: Length 1 1/2" Width 1/2" CONDITION: The piece is in good vintage condition with a heavy patina and light wear. SHOP MORE JEWELRY: https://www.etsy.com/shop/SouthwestVintage?ref=seller-platform-mcnav&search_query=jewelry SEE THE REST OF MY SHOP: www.etsy.com/shop/southwestvintage *International orders are sent USPS First Class mail without insurance and tracking is not guaranteed, for shipping up grade contact me for price quote. SEE THE REST OF MY SHOP: www.etsy.com/shop/southwestvintage STORE POLICY FOR RETURNS: We inspect all items and do our best to describe them. They are vintage thus preowned so not in new condition. If we have miss anything or there are any issues please contact us and let us know. We will take care of any problems. If an item does not work out for you we offer RETURNS FOR STORE CREDIT ONLY.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
