  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-native-american-pueblo-7-storyteller-pottery-doll-necklace-hand-crafted-', '4583315510', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4583315510/vintage-native-american-pueblo-7?click_key=EuF0FihyIEpKRoa5cd1jahRJH-99%3ALT8e7b87b2b2704a5bb9fb7c84b7abbc07e3195629&click_sum=6ff8c558&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-676139-20-7&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Vintage Native American Pueblo 7 storyteller pottery doll necklace Hand-crafted terracotta pottery 27 inches', 'This is a charming and rare vintage Native American Pueblo storyteller pottery doll necklace. First pioneered at Cochiti and Jemez Pueblos to honor tribal elders sharing oral wisdom, this wearable folk art piece features 7 individual hand-sculpted terracotta clay storyteller figurines. Each figure is depicted in traditional seated posture with open mouths, tenderly cradling miniature children in their arms. The figures are spaced evenly along a continuous 27-inch strand of natural brown heishe beads, allowing it to easily slip over the head. Multi-figure storyteller necklaces are scarce compared to tabletop pottery sculptures, making this a true treasure for collectors of Southwestern folk art and Native American jewelry. Item Details & Measurements: Material: Hand-crafted terracotta pottery with natural slip pigment and heishe beads Length: Approximately 27.0 inches total strand length (continuous slip-on) Figurine Count: 7 detailed miniature clay storyteller dolls holding children Doll Dimensions: Each figure measures approximately 1.0 inch tall by 0.60 inches wide Cultural Symbolism: Represents tribal storytelling, family legacy, and the preservation of generational history. Great addition to any jewelry or Native American art collection. Comes in jewelry gift box-Free domestic shipping! Refunds and Exchanges We do accept returns within 30 days of the purchase of the item. However, the buyer is responsible for shipping the item back to us and that cost will not be refunded. We will refund your money for the item as soon as we receive the item back. Please send the item back to us with tracking.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
